&lt;li&gt;software engineering concepts and best practices (e.g., versioning, testing, CI/CD, API design, MLOps);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;container-ization and orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes, Slurm);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;writing pipelines and experiment environments, including running experiments in pipelines in a systematic way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
